M-U-L, before we talk about the game at all though, just one thing in my research that I usually save for the M,

00:01:21.780 --> 00:01:23.540
but I think it's worth talking about at the top here.

00:01:23.660 --> 00:01:31.460
It's a pretty big headline. M-U-L was one of the first five games from brand new company Electronic Arts.

00:01:32.480 --> 00:01:36.440
