Took me a second. Yeah, you concede, right?

00:01:45.560 --> 00:01:46.680
I challenge everything.

00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:47.940
Okay, very good.

00:01:48.520 --> 00:01:56.220
Yeah, this is a pretty big deal, I feel like, but also anybody who's, you know, aware of video game history or anything,

00:01:56.460 --> 00:02:03.280
that should be a sign that this game is also very old because EA did not become a company in 1990.

