00:20:44.300 --> 00:20:48.640
So you kind of repeat that loop, of course, now with more limited resources, right?

00:20:48.720 --> 00:20:49.960
You probably have less money.

00:20:49.960 --> 00:20:52.180
You have less land to choose from.

00:20:52.180 --> 00:21:03.600
